1.desc:
The equipping character becomes the center of attention when they use their Elemental Skill or Elemental Burst, and gains different Attention effects:
Blazing Attention: CRIT DMG is increased by <color=#99FFFFFF>48%</color> for the next 10s;
Dazzling Attention: Stellar Swirl reaction DMG is increased by <color=#99FFFFFF>28%</color> for the next 10s;
Radiant Attention: Regenerates <color=#99FFFFFF>3</color> Elemental Energy.
Each trigger applies one of the above effects, cycling through the sequence above.

